# Context for deploy/web.Dockerfile (the repository root): only the pnpm
# workspace files and web/. BuildKit uses this instead of .dockerignore.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.npmrc
!web
web/e2e
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
